<% const base = '/plans/' + data.trip.id; %>
<a class="back-link" href="<%= base %>"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-back"/></svg>Back to research board</a><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Good company makes the trip.</h1><p>Share the invite. They add their name. You figure out the rest together.</p></div></div>
<div class="share-layout"><div><section class="invite-panel"><h2>A link for your travel crew</h2><p>Anyone with this link can join <strong><%= data.trip.name %></strong>, add ideas, vote, and comment. Share it privately.</p><label for="invite-link">Private invite link</label><div class="copy-field"><input id="invite-link" readonly value="<%= data.invitePath %>" data-invite-path="<%= data.invitePath %>"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-copy="invite-link"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-copy"/></svg>Copy link</button></div><p class="fine-print">Running on localhost? Other people can’t reach your computer using this address. Open the app through a reachable host before copying a link for them.</p><noscript><p>Prefix this path with your app’s address before sharing it.</p></noscript><details class="invite-controls"><summary>Replace the invite link</summary><p>The old link will stop accepting new joins. People already in the trip stay signed in.</p><form method="post" action="<%= base %>/invite/rotate" data-confirm="Replace the invite? The old link will no longer accept new joins."><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="button secondary">Create a new invite link</button></form></details></section>
<section class="people-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Who’s coming along <span class="count"><%= data.members.length %></span></h2></div><form class="travelers-form" method="post" action="<%= base %>/travelers"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="trip-travelers">Travelers on this trip</label><div class="travelers-row"><input id="trip-travelers" class="travelers-input" type="number" name="travelers" min="1" max="100" placeholder="–" value="<%= data.trip.travelers || '' %>" aria-describedby="travelers-hint"><button class="button secondary small">Save</button></div><p class="fine-print" id="travelers-hint">Can differ from who joined here. Totals are divided by this number for a rough per-person estimate. Leave empty to hide it.</p></form><div class="people-list"><% data.members.forEach(member => { %><div class="person-row"><div class="member"><span class="avatar"><%= h.initials(member.name) %></span><span><strong><%= member.name %></strong><small><%= member.is_organizer ? 'Organizer · manages the trip' : member.is_agent ? 'Assistant · adds research through the API' : 'Contributor · ideas, votes & comments' %></small></span></div><% if (!member.is_organizer) { %><form method="post" action="<%= base %>/members/<%= member.id %>/remove" data-confirm="Remove this person’s access? Their contributions will remain. Replace the invite link too if it is no longer trusted."><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="button danger subtle">Remove<span class="sr-only"> <%= member.name %></span></button></form><% } else { %><span class="badge shortlisted">Organizer</span><% } %></div><% }) %></div></section></div>
<aside class="editor-guide"><svg class="guide-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><h2>Private, not anonymous.</h2><p>Names show who added what. They’re not verified accounts, so this works best with people you trust.</p><ul><li>Companions can edit their own ideas.</li><li>You manage access and final selections.</li><li>Removing someone blocks their current session.</li><li>Rotate the invite too if an excluded person could rejoin in another browser.</li></ul><p class="fine-print">Keep passports, payment information, and sensitive booking documents out of this research space.</p></aside></div>